elaborate_top: a divider at the top joined by a subcircuit's parallel resistor through one elaborate (v(2) = 10 * 4.5k/5.5k = 8.1818): VACASK keeps the top's own elements beside the named body
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
v1 (1 0) vsource dc=10.0
r1 (1 2) resistor r=1k
r2 (2 0) resistor r=9k
subckt par2()
  rp2 (2 0) resistor r=9k
ends
control
  elaborate circuit("par2")
  analysis op1 op
endc
